## Authored Godot vector illustrations for the music-edit viewpoints.
## Not a replacement rig. Existing character/pose/face/hand libraries are untouched.
## No generated bitmap art, no reference-video frames, no per-frame random lines.
var author := "nemi"
var view := "front"
var emotion := "shy"
